<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ANZ,Stan Chart consider merger-report.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ANZ,Stan Chart consider merger-report.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australia and New Zealand Banking Group Ltd (ANZ) and the London-based Standard Chartered Plc are investigating a A$24 billion stock merger to create an Asian powerhouse bank, The Australian Financial Review said on Monday.</p>
<p>The newspaper said the two banks had engaged Goldman Sachs and Swiss Bank Corp to advise on the structure of the deal.</p>
</text>
